      "report": "## Disposition — agent-a762d2f4f813bb616, unmatched entries only\n\n**Context:** worktree HEAD `0d81c5f` (2026-10-14) is an ancestor of `main` (`1a2151d`, 2026-10-17); `main` has 118 commits after it. Both unmatched files are *uncommitted* working-tree edits, never in any ref (verified via `--find-object` across all refs). So this is an abandoned draft, not published work.\n\n**A) `README.md` (candidate blob `31b1f1a` vs main `ec2451a`) — fully superseded.**\nThe candidate describes the U1/U2-only phase: “no workers ni integración GitHub real”, “sin remoto configurado”, “No se publica en GitHub”. All false against today’s main (native Pi job entry, issue #1/PR #2, model-routing, quality checks). Main retains the U1/U2 links the candidate introduced (`docs/u1-usage.md`, `docs/u2-usage.md`), the .audit evidence convention, S01 status, and the “Markdown is an instruction, not a runtime” framing. Main adds the current native-worker status, CI, ESLint/Knip, QoC tooling. **Missing material: none.** No candidate line states a requirement absent from main.\n\n**B) `.agents/skills/isswf-coordinator/SKILL.md` (candidate blob `499c181` vs main `e79f9b4`, untracked dir) — fully superseded.**\nThe candidate is a shorter, **Pstack-dependent** rewrite (`pstack` extension active, `pstack:poteto-agent-high` + `openai-codex/gpt-6-luna` hard requirement, no fallback). It deletes the native worker path, diagnostician profile, model-routing pins, TOTAL actor-budget/reconciliation rules, independent-review snapshot discipline, and detailed optional Engram/Codegraph handling. Main is strictly larger and explicitly states the worker path **does not require Pstack** — i.e. main already satisfies the desired Pstack independence; the candidate would regress it. Its one distinctive line, `[isswf-triage](../isswf-triage/SKILL.md)` treated as an in-package sibling, is directly contradicted by main’s current SKILL (“intentionally not included in this resource package; source-checkout workflow only”). **Missing material: none.** No candidate requirement is absent from main.\n\n**Verdict:** no lost work. Both unmatched paths are an obsolete, uncommitted draft against a 118-commit-old base; every substantive requirement survives (evolved) in main, and the Pstack-only dispatch model is deliberate supersession. No line-level carryover recommended. No implementation or worktree cleanup performed.",
